"cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-9r[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Today marks: a 🍅 on task lines that are on today's plan[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every open #task line whose task is on today's plan (it has a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]dedicated Task Link under one of today's open Pomodoros) shows a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]display-only 🍅 Today mark right after its identity glyph. The mark[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]appears in Live Preview, and in rendered views wherever the line's [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]identity is exact. Its tooltip names the Pomodoro and whether it is[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]running or queued. Mod+click and a keyboard command jump to the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Task Link, and a session toggle hides every mark. The mark is [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]truthful or neutral: it never guesses, never goes stale, and is [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]never written.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]today_marks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/today_marks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-9r[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-9r/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Today marks display contract in bob-cli docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: write the authoritative docs/today-marks.md display contract [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with conformance vectors TM1–TM23, link it from docs/README.md and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/plan.md §Today, and (only if the memory decision is yes) add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decisions-web record.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Today cache details, generation guard, and revalidation[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cache[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cache: extend the bob-ledger-tools Today cache with per-key Pomodoro [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]details, a per-note id index, entered-key timestamps, and a details [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]signature that refreshes only the marks. Add an async generation guard [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and focus/visibility revalidation, all with clock-injected tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Today mark pure core, widget, and styles[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mark_core[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cache[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mark_core: add src/143-today-marks.js (line candidate, insert offset, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]duplicate ids, session text, tooltip, listener-free element, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]TodayMarkWidget) plus the styles.css block and a new test suite for the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pure vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Today marks in Live Preview with toggle and jump[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]live_preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract, mark_core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]live_preview: add the src/275-plugin-today-marks.js mixin (ViewPlugin [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decorations, refresh fan-out, session toggle, the Mod+click and keyboard[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]jump to the Task Link) and lifecycle wiring. Run the TM vectors against [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Live Preview, then bump, build, test, and sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Today marks in rendered views[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]reading[dim] · [dim][/dim]after live_preview[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reading: add src/276-plugin-today-marks-reading.js. Rendered rows get [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]marks only on exact section mapping and stay neutral otherwise. Add row [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stamping with a live refresh sweep, the daily-note view class, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]delegated Mod+click, then test, bump, and sync.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-9r","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-9r.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a7af3ea58bf078cafedd2c128e377d87","started_at":"2026-10-19T13:49:41.603891+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"9eedd3696cf2156caed7845a622e9351d55c0b48ec2e76fc7ae16af4764264ef","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9r.5/chat.md","size_bytes":4631},"commits":{"digest":"f8390c63ac6926951452505917c9f162fa0e463fd1ce59ead4c3047980c8bdca","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9r.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9r.5/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"fb3d64ae7e9ec1a801d377ee2eaa83505a29a5ac3d642118cd62406bc16e5ba0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9r.5/meta.json","size_bytes":684},"prompt":{"digest":"c6a3ab4fc6f9ce94d3ac86621ff78d4d71b94ff48a0b5d8cc3759663682bfe49","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9r.5/prompt.md","size_bytes":176},"pro